	(text "Measured 16.10.2026: 1/2 = 24 V (29 V no load), 3/4 = +5 V (not used).\nFAN1 (EXTRACT): 10 tacho, 12 motor GND, 14 PWM input (0 V = stop), 16 +10 V.\nFAN2 (SUPPLY): 18, 20, 22, 24 in the same order. Motor GNDs isolated on 439155 -> tied to GND.\n13 = LS (ISP814, 5 V pull-up 2k2 on 439155), 26 = bypass relay drive (BC337 base).\n28/30 = NTC TEMP1 (extract air), 32/34 = NTC TEMP2 (outdoor intake): 28/32 to GND, 30/34 to the ADC.\n15/17/19/21 = original SHT1x humidity sensor - not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 112 0)
