	(text "Q1/Q2 base pull-up 22k from the MOTOR +10 V: Ib 0.42 mA, Ic 2.1 mA (hFE > 5) -> PWM input 0 V -> fan 0 %.\nQ3/Q4 pull that base low only while the GPIO drives HIGH (4k7, Ib 0.48 mA) -> 4k7 lifts the PWM -> fan runs.\nFirmware: NON-inverted PWM (GPIO high = run). Reset / high-Z, DevKit unplugged, 3V3 lost or shorted,\n+5V lost (F1, U1, D2) or ESP unpowered -> Q3/Q4 off (10k to GND) -> fans 0 % as long as the motors have 10 V.\nNo path depends on an unpowered GPIO (preorder review P2).\nA HUNG program keeps its last PWM: the firmware must keep the ESP32 task watchdog enabled.\nTacho: open collector, 1 pulse/rev, 10k pull-up to 3.3 V, 1k + 1n low-pass to the GPIO (PCNT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "eb20f56c-830f-529b-9633-d9f3645f46cd")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 305 145)
		(end 585 275)
		(stroke
