	(text "BYPASS_OUT -> BC337 + relay RL1 on 439155 (230 V damper actuator). GPIO15 is high-Z at reset (no pull on the\nDevKit): R12 10k holds the BC337 base low -> relay off in reset, bootloader and without the DevKit (E-03).\nLS: ISP814 pulls 100 Hz pulses low while the light switch is live; 10k/22k -> 3.4 V max.\nNTC 5k @ 25 C (B ~3950) between J1 28/30 (TEMP1) and 32/34 (TEMP2), 10k pull-up to 3.3 V,\neach on its own ADC1 channel (GPIO1 / GPIO2): no NTC multiplexing, no CH340 back-feed (alpha issue).\nOpen NTC -> 3.3 V, short -> 0 V: both rejected by the firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4c366d2-6be4-5fc4-b4f5-4b4850181e74")
	)
