	(text "JST-XH 3-pin: 1 = 3V3, 2 = DATA, 3 = GND (same as rev D). Series 100R per connector LIMIT the current into the\nESP32 pin clamps; they do not set a safe clamp voltage. No dedicated TVS (review E-04: open decision, depends on\nthe cable lengths - all sensor cables stay inside the unit)."
